{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.BraidKnot.HookSumBetaCoordinates","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.HookSumBetaCoordinates","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.BraidKnot.HookSumClosedForm","lean:module:QOU.SchurWeyl.SchurPrincipalBetaForm"],"declarations":13,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.HookSum.sum_hookZ_betaForm_of_hookMultiset","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.HookSum.sum_hookZ_betaForm_of_hookMultiset","kind":"theorem","line":361,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/HookSumBetaCoordinates.lean#L361-L400","doc":"**(II), proved a second time** — from the hook multiset (I') rather than from\nthe closed form.  Statement identical to `two_mul_sum_hookZ_betaForm`, and it needs\n**no** column bound `M`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.HookSum.two_mul_sum_desc","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.HookSum.two_mul_sum_desc","kind":"theorem","line":349,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/HookSumBetaCoordinates.lean#L349-L359","doc":"`2 Σ_{j<b} (b − j) = b(b+1)`: the descending sum `b + (b−1) + ⋯ + 1`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.HookSum.wenzlHook_cast","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.HookSum.wenzlHook_cast","kind":"theorem","line":338,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/HookSumBetaCoordinates.lean#L338-L347","doc":"The corpus's `ℕ`-valued hook, cast to `ℤ`, is `hookZ` — on a genuine cell,\nwhere both truncated subtractions are honest. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.HookSum.betaSide_padding_invariant","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.HookSum.betaSide_padding_invariant","kind":"theorem","line":315,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/HookSumBetaCoordinates.lean#L315-L329","doc":"**Padding invariance, subtraction-free.**  The same statement over a mere additive\ncommutative *monoid*: the β-side at `L` and at `L'` agree, written without subtraction\nby adding the other padding's pair sum to each. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.HookSum.betaSide_eq_hookSum","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.HookSum.betaSide_eq_hookSum","kind":"theorem","line":299,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/HookSumBetaCoordinates.lean#L299-L313","doc":"**The β-side is the cell sum.**  For any `g` into an additive commutative *group*,\n\n    Σ_{i<L} Σ_{m=1}^{β_i} g(m) − Σ_{i<j<L} g(β_i − β_j) = Σ_{c∈μ} g(h(c)) .\n\nThe right-hand side carries no `L`, so the left-hand side is the same for every\npadding `L ≥ ℓ(μ)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.HookSum.sum_hookF_add_pairF","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.HookSum.sum_hookF_add_pairF","kind":"theorem","line":252,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/HookSumBetaCoordinates.lean#L252-L273","doc":"**(I')** For **any** `g : ℕ → N` into an additive commutative monoid,\n\n    Σ_{c∈μ} g(h(c)) + Σ_{i<j<L} g(β_i − β_j) = Σ_{i<L} Σ_{m=1}^{β_i} g(m),\n\nfor every padding `L ≥ ℓ(μ)`.  The `j`-index runs as `i+1+k`, matching the\ncorpus's `hookSide_betaR`; `sum_hookZ_betaForm_of_hookMultiset` below reindexes it\nto `Ico (i+1) L`.\n\nRow `i`'s hook lengths are `{1, …, β_i}` with `{β_i − β_j : j > i}` removed — that\nis the whole content, and it is `hookSide_betaR`'s, not this file's. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.HookSum.two_mul_sum_hookZ_betaForm","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.HookSum.two_mul_sum_hookZ_betaForm","kind":"theorem","line":176,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/HookSumBetaCoordinates.lean#L176-L236","doc":"**(II) The hook sum in β-coordinates**, doubled to stay in `ℤ`:\n\n    2 Σ_{c∈μ} h(c) = Σ_{i<L} β_i(β_i + 1) − 2 Σ_{i<j<L} (β_i − β_j),\n\nfor any padding `L ≥ ℓ(μ)` and any column bound `M ≥ λ_1`.  Equivalently\n`Σ_c h(c) = Σ_i C(β_i + 1, 2) − Σ_{i<j}(β_i − β_j)`, which is the row-indexed\nform of the statement that row `i`'s hooks are `{1,…,β_i} ∖ {β_i − β_j : j > i}`.\n\nDerived from `two_mul_sum_hookZ_eq_sum_sq` and the `n(λ)`-register lemmas, **not**\nfrom the hook multiset. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.HookSum.sum_pair_betaR_sub","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.HookSum.sum_pair_betaR_sub","kind":"theorem","line":158,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/HookSumBetaCoordinates.lean#L158-L174","doc":"The `Σ_{i<j}(β_i − β_j)` pair sum, collapsed to a single row sum:\n`Σ_{i<j<L} (β_i − β_j) = Σ_{i<L} (L − 1 − 2i) β_i`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.HookSum.two_mul_sum_betaR","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.HookSum.two_mul_sum_betaR","kind":"theorem","line":139,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/HookSumBetaCoordinates.lean#L139-L156","doc":"**(III) The β-numbers sum to `n + L(L−1)/2`**, doubled to stay in `ℤ`:\n`2 Σ_{i<L} β_i = 2n + L(L−1)`, for any padding `L` covering the diagram. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.HookSum.sum_Ico_upper_swap","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.HookSum.sum_Ico_upper_swap","kind":"theorem","line":119,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/HookSumBetaCoordinates.lean#L119-L135","doc":"**Upper-triangular sum swap.** `Σ_{i<L} Σ_{i<j<L} g j = Σ_{j<L} j·g j`: the\nvalue `g j` is counted once for each `i < j`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.HookSum.sum_shift_quad_eq_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.HookSum.sum_shift_quad_eq_zero","kind":"theorem","line":90,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/HookSumBetaCoordinates.lean#L90-L117","doc":"**The pure-`L` part of the β-form vanishes.** With `m_i = L − 1 − i`,\n`−3 Σ m_i² + (2L−1) Σ m_i = 0` for every `L` — the reason (II) is independent of\nthe padding. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.HookSum.six_mul_sum_range_sq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.HookSum.six_mul_sum_range_sq","kind":"theorem","line":79,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/HookSumBetaCoordinates.lean#L79-L88","doc":"`6 · Σ_{i<L} i² = L(L−1)(2L−1)`, the square-pyramidal closed form over `ℤ`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.HookSum.betaR_cast","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.HookSum.betaR_cast","kind":"theorem","line":70,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/HookSumBetaCoordinates.lean#L70-L75","doc":"The β-number of row `i`, cast to `ℤ`, for `i` inside the padded row range. ","signatureChunk":0}]}